      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING ALADDIN (2) filled a minor placing last start at The Gardens behind Fascinate Samuel (34.91) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Can measure up this time. CONDO BANDIT (1) produced a moderate effort last time when fifth at this track over 520m behind Ritza Sophie (30.05) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Bold showing expected. ZIPPING VIOLET (8) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (23.58) at Richmond last time. Has a good record here at this journey. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from seven attempts. Likely to be thereabouts. WINSOME STORM (7) recorded a commanding victory last time. Right in the mix.",
